# Aero Publishing — Project Workflow

## Scope

- The user provides **content** and **design**. Do not invent copy, layouts, or features unless explicitly requested.
- **Do only what is asked.** Do not add pages, components, styling, SEO tags, or refactors beyond the current request.
- Do not proactively add documentation, tests, or extras unless requested.

## Implementation

- Match provided design and content exactly when supplied.
- Reuse existing patterns in this codebase (Next.js App Router, Tailwind CSS, Lucide React icons).
- Keep changes minimal and focused.

## WordPress → Next.js migration context

This site replaces a WordPress site. When building or migrating pages, preserve SEO-critical elements (see `seo-migration.mdc`).
